% Slice 1 math fixture (docs/plans/math-engine.md): `${...}` inline math is
% core syntax (lexer + CST + elaboration already existed and permissively
% type-checked), so this is a plain `stdja-mini` fixture with no
% `@require: math` — the math package isn't loaded yet (§G), and Slice 1
% renders the elaborator-lowered `MathElem` tree directly via `read_math`.

@require: stdja-mini

document (|
  title = {Math};
  author = {yasuo};
|) '<
  +p { here is ${x^2} and ${a+b}. }
>
